### Install ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code, lalu klik "Send Request"
@host = http://localhost:4000
@key = rahasia123

### BERHASIL 1 - GET semua
GET {{host}}/api/buku

### BERHASIL 2 - GET by ID
GET {{host}}/api/buku/1

### BERHASIL 3 - POST
POST {{host}}/api/buku
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "judul": "Dilan 1990", "penulis": "Pidi Baiq", "tahun": 2014 }

### BERHASIL 4 - PUT
PUT {{host}}/api/buku/1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "judul": "Laskar Pelangi (Edisi Baru)", "penulis": "Andrea Hirata", "tahun": 2008 }

### BERHASIL 5 - DELETE
DELETE {{host}}/api/buku/2
x-api-key: {{key}}

### GAGAL 1 - tanpa API key (401)
POST {{host}}/api/buku
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Tanpa Key", "penulis": "X", "tahun": 2020 }

### GAGAL 2 - data tidak lengkap (400)
POST {{host}}/api/buku
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "judul": "Hanya Judul" }

### GAGAL 3 - JSON rusak (400)
POST {{host}}/api/buku
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "judul": "Rusak", "penulis": }

### GAGAL 4 - ID tidak ditemukan (404)
GET {{host}}/api/buku/999
